        "out_csv_file.title": "Output File",
        "rule_type.descr": "<xdoc><p>The type of rule to export.</p><ul><li><span title=\"ALL\">All</span>—All the rules in the utility network will be exported.</li><li><span title=\"JUNCTION_JUNCTION_CONNECTIVITY\">Junction-junction connectivity</span>—Junction-junction connectivity association rules will be exported.</li><li><span title=\"JUNCTION_EDGE_CONNECTIVITY\">Junction-edge connectivity</span>—Junction-edge connectivity rules will be exported.</li><li><span title=\"CONTAINMENT\">Containment</span>—Containment association rules will be exported.</li><li><span title=\"STRUCTURAL_ATTACHMENT\">Structural attachment</span>—Structural attachment association rules will be exported.</li><li><span title=\"EDGE_JUNCTION_EDGE_CONNECTIVITY\">Edge-junction-edge connectivity</span>—Edge-junction-edge connectivity association rules will be exported.</li></ul></xdoc>",
